<h2>Highlights</h2>
<ul><li><em>[The one to three changes most people care about]</em></li></ul>
<ac:structured-macro ac:name="warning"><ac:parameter ac:name="title">Action required</ac:parameter>
<ac:rich-text-body>
<p><em>[Anything operators or users must do before or after upgrading. Delete this box if there is nothing.]</em></p>
</ac:rich-text-body>
</ac:structured-macro>
<h2>Added</h2>
<ul><li><em>[New capability, with a link to its documentation]</em></li></ul>
<h2>Changed</h2>
<ul><li><em>[Changed behavior. Say what it was before and what it is now.]</em></li></ul>
<h2>Deprecated</h2>
<ul><li><em>[Still works but will be removed; give the removal version and the replacement]</em></li></ul>
<h2>Removed</h2>
<ul><li><em>[Feature or option that no longer exists]</em></li></ul>
<h2>Fixed</h2>
<ul><li><em>[Bug fixed, described by symptom]</em></li></ul>
<h2>Security</h2>
<ul><li><em>[Vulnerability addressed, with CVE if public]</em></li></ul>
<h2>Upgrade notes</h2>
<ol><li><em>[Prerequisite, for example: requires database schema version 12]</em></li><li><em>[Step or link to the upgrade runbook]</em></li><li><em>[Rollback: how far back is supported]</em></li></ol>
<h2>Known issues</h2>
